<Base
  title="What I offer"
  description="Customised gifts and hampers, art and showpieces, handmade pieces made to use, and art lessons, by Fatema Boxwala in Indore."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>What I offer</h1>
    <p>Everything is made to order, by hand, for one person and one occasion.</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Gifts and hampers</h2>
    <p>
      Themed wadhavani trays, shitabi packing, dry-fruit bouquets, hampers, and birthday surprises
      built around one idea.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Art and showpieces</h2>
    <p>Framed portrait sketches in graphite, string art, and miniature scenes in clay.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Made to use</h2>
    <p>
      Namakdanis made to a theme, clay keychains and bag charms, personalised mirrors, and
      hand-painted ridas.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Art lessons</h2>
    <p>I teach drawing and painting. Message me to ask about lessons.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How an order works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Tell me your wish: what you would like made, the occasion, and your vision or theme.</li>
      <li>I suggest a design and we agree the details.</li>
      <li>I make your piece by hand and pack it with care.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</Base>
